# Tailwind classes only

All visual styling in this repo goes through Tailwind utility classes via `cn(...)`.

## Disallowed

- `*.module.css` files
- `styled-components`, `@emotion/*`, any CSS-in-JS
- `<style>` tags in JSX
- New global CSS files (only `src/app/globals.css` and `src/styles/tokens.css` exist)
- `style={{ color: ..., padding: ..., fontSize: ... }}` — any static style prop

## Single carve-out

GSAP-driven dynamic transforms / opacity that GSAP itself writes inline are fine:

```tsx
style={{ transform: `translateX(${x}px)` }}  // OK if x is computed at runtime
```

## Token-backed only

Use the token-mapped utilities (defined in `globals.css` `@theme inline`):

| Concern  | Use                                                       | Avoid                |
| -------- | --------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- |
| Color    | `bg-bg`, `text-fg`, `border-border`, `bg-primary`         | `bg-[#fff]`, `text-zinc-900` |
| Spacing  | `p-4`, `gap-2`, `space-y-6`                               | `p-[15px]`           |
| Radius   | `rounded-md`, `rounded-full`                              | `rounded-[12px]`     |
| Shadow   | `shadow-low`, `shadow-mid`, `shadow-high`                 | `shadow-[0_2px_…]`   |

If a value isn't expressible via tokens, **add a token first** (in `tokens.css` + `tokens.ts`) — don't escape to arbitrary values.
